cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  GEM Creole: Genome-scale Metabolic Model of Solanum tuberosum
  Group Phureja (Cultivar 'Criolla Colombia')
message: >-
  If you use this model in your research, please cite it using
  the metadata from this file.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Oscar
    # family-names: TODO
    # orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000'
    affiliation: Universidad Nacional de Colombia
repository-code: 'https://github.com/oquinterol/GEMs-Phureja-Creole'
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 2.0.0
date-released: '2026-02-19'
keywords:
  - genome-scale metabolic model
  - GEM
  - Solanum tuberosum
  - potato
  - Criolla Colombia
  - flux balance analysis
  - SBML
  - constraint-based modeling
abstract: >-
  Genome-scale metabolic reconstruction of Solanum tuberosum Group
  Phureja (Cultivar 'Criolla Colombia'). The model contains 1,063
  reactions, 1,078 metabolites, and 2,048 genes with MIRIAM
  annotations. Built from KBase draft reconstruction with eggNOG-mapper
  functional annotations (162K annotations, 1,328 EC numbers).
  SBML Level 3 Version 2 + FBC v2 compliant.
